y\",\n  \"description\": \"Apply (use) a tool. If used on a wand, that wand will be broken, releasing its magic in the process.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_eat ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_eat\",\n  \"description\": \"Eat something from your inventory or straight from the ground.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_drink ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_drink\",\n  \"description\": \"Drink something from your inventory or straight from the ground.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_tip ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_tip\",\n  \"description\": \"Tip out the content of a container.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_dip ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_dip\",\n  \"description\": \"Dip an object into something.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_kick ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_kick\",\n  \"description\": \"Kick something.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_rest ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_rest\",\n  \"description\": \"Rests n-moves while doing nothing or until something happens (default=5).\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_cast ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_cast\",\n  \"description\": \"Opens your spellbook to cast a spell.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_pay ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_pay\",\n  \"description\": \"Pay your shopping bill.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_pray ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_pray\",\n  \"description\": \"Pray to the gods for help.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_look ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_look\",\n  \"description\": \"Look at what is under you.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_set_avoid_monster_flag ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_set_avoid_monster_flag\",\n  \"description\": \"If set to true skills will try to avoid monsters.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_melee_attack ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_melee_attack\",\n  \"description\": \"Pursues and attacks a given target using melee attacks until it is dead.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {}\n}\n\n=== np_explore_level ===\n{\n  \"name\": \"np_explore_level\",\n  \"description\": 